  "usage_note": "**Enough** comes before a noun (*enough money*) but after an adjective or adverb (*rich enough*, *quickly enough*); it never comes between an adjective and its noun. **Enough** used alone, without a noun, or after an adjective or adverb, belongs to separate entries.",
  "learner_errors": [
